1. What is SharePoint?

    SharePoint Online is Microsoft's cloud platform for storing, organizing, sharing, securing, and collaborating on 
    business information and documents.
    
    A company can use it for:
        Company intranet
        Team/project sites
        Document storage and collaboration
        Business data in Lists
        Approval processes
        Knowledge/document management
        Secure file sharing
        Power Apps / Power Automate solutions
